 "items": {
  "1": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Tezlik koordinatadan olingan hosila, tezlanish esa tezlikdan olingan hosila. Har bir mulohazani tekshiramiz:"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**m)** $v$ = const > 0 (1-grafik) bo‘lsa, $x=x_0+vt$ — o‘suvchi to‘g‘ri chiziq, $x_0<0$ da 3-grafik. To‘g‘ri."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**n)** $v=at$ (4-grafik) bo‘lsa, $x=at^2/2$ — o‘suvchi va tobora tiklashuvchi parabola, 5-grafik. To‘g‘ri."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**k)** $v$ = const < 0 (2-grafik) bo‘lsa, $x$ kamayuvchi to‘g‘ri chiziq bo‘ladi. Bunday grafik rasmda yo‘q, shuning uchun mulohaza to‘g‘ri."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**p)** $a$ = const < 0 (2-grafik), $v_0>0$ bo‘lsa, $x=v_0t-|a|t^2/2$ — qiyaligi kamayib boruvchi egri, 6-grafik. To‘g‘ri."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**q)** $a$ = const > 0 bo‘lsa, $x(t)$ parabola bo‘ladi, to‘g‘ri chiziq (4-grafik) emas. Noto‘g‘ri."
   },
   {
    "t": "status",
    "kind": "source_error",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Tahlilga ko‘ra **k** mulohaza ham to‘g‘ri, shuning uchun C (m; n; p) va D (n; k; p) variantlarining ikkalasi ham faqat to‘g‘ri mulohazalardan iborat. Javoblar kaliti C ni belgilagan."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** m; n; p (javoblar kaliti bo‘yicha)"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "2": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$v_0=144$ km/h $=40$ m/s, $a=-4$ m/s² (o‘zgarmas), $t=20$ s"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Jism $t_1=v_0/|a|=10$ s da to‘xtaydi. Tezlanish o‘zgarmas bo‘lgani uchun keyingi 10 s da u teskari yo‘nalishda tezlanadi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "s_1=\\frac{v_0^2}{2|a|}=\\frac{1600}{8}=200\\ \\text{m},\\qquad s_2=\\frac{|a|t_2^2}{2}=\\frac{4\\cdot100}{2}=200\\ \\text{m}"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "s=s_1+s_2=400\\ \\text{m}"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "(Ko‘chish nolga teng, yo‘l esa 400 m.)"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** 400 m"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "3": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "20 m dan erkin tushish vaqti $t=\\sqrt{2h/g}=2$ s. Qiya otilgan jismning uchish vaqti:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "t=\\frac{2v_0\\sin53^\\circ}{g}=2\\;\\Rightarrow\\;v_0=\\frac{10}{0{,}8}=12{,}5\\ \\text{m/s}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 12,5 m/s"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "4": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{P_\\uparrow}{P_\\downarrow}=\\frac{m(g+a)}{m(g-a)}=\\frac{12}{8}=1{,}5"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 1,5"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "5": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "g=\\frac{GM}{R^2}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\frac{g'}{g}=\\frac{M'}{M}\\cdot\\frac{R^2}{R'^2}=4\\cdot4=16,\\qquad g'=160\\ \\text{m/s}^2"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 160 m/s²"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "6": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "F=\\sqrt{15^2+20^2}=25\\ \\text{N},\\quad a=\\frac{F}{m}=10\\ \\text{m/s}^2,\\quad v=at=30\\ \\text{m/s}"
