      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** Arximed kuchi hamma holatlarda bir xil bo‘ladi"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "8": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$M=12$ kg, sterjen 8 ta teng bo‘lakdan iborat (bo‘lak uzunligi $l$), tayanch chapdan $l$ masofada, $T=80$ N o‘ng uchda, yuk chapdan $6l$ da"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Tayanchga nisbatan yelkalar: $T$ uchun $7l$, sterjen og‘irligi (o‘rtasida, $4l$) uchun $3l$, yuk uchun $5l$."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "T\\cdot7l=Mg\\cdot3l+mg\\cdot5l\\;\\Rightarrow\\;560=360+50m\\;\\Rightarrow\\;m=4\\ \\text{kg}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
