  "12": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Porshenlar vaznsiz, muvozanatda tutash idishlarda bir sathdagi bosimlar teng."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**1-rasm:** X yuki bor porshen $h$ ga past, demak $\\dfrac{X}{S}=\\rho gh$."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**2-rasm:** porshenlar bir sathda, demak $\\dfrac XS=\\dfrac{Y}{2S}$, bundan $Y=2X$."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**3-rasm:** X va Y ikkalasi $S$ porshenda:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{X+Y}{S}=\\rho gh_1\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\frac{3X}{S}=\\rho gh_1\\;\\Rightarrow\\;h_1=3h"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** 3"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
